    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Agent 技能演化：从轨迹回流到可剪枝的程序性记忆</title>
      <link>https://chengguruchun.github.io/articles/agent-skill-evolution-pruning.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://chengguruchun.github.io/articles/agent-skill-evolution-pruning.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <category>Articles</category>
      <description>把执行轨迹蒸馏成技能已被两代工作证明有效，但「技能如何停止增长」被留给了未来工作。剪枝的关键转换：不追踪模型为什么用一节，只测量删掉之后效果变不变。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
